  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.1",
   "range": "EXO.24.1",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "0246a4c8",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.1#p1-0246a4c8",
     "text": "When he called him up to the mountain to give him the laws, beginning at the 20th chapter till now.",
     "label": "a",
     "anchor": "said unto Moses"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.3",
   "range": "EXO.24.3",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "5e9fcdc0",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.3#p1-5e9fcdc0",
     "text": "When he had received these laws in mount Sinai.",
     "label": "b",
     "anchor": "And Moses came and told the"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.5",
   "range": "EXO.24.5",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "571d9619",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.5#p1-571d9619",
     "text": "For as yet the priesthood was not given to Levi.",
     "label": "c",
     "anchor": "men of the children of Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.8",
   "range": "EXO.24.8",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "3173671a",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.8#p1-3173671a",
     "text": "Which signifies that the covenant broken cannot be satisfied without shedding of blood.",
     "label": "d",
     "anchor": "blood of the covenant"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.10",
   "range": "EXO.24.10",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "dd076de7",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.10#p1-dd076de7",
     "text": "As perfectly as their infirmities could behold his majesty.",
     "label": "e",
     "anchor": "saw the God of Israel"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.11",
   "range": "EXO.24.11",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "afd19bc3",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.11#p1-20a3f951",
     "text": "He did not make them afraid, nor punish them.",
     "label": "f",
     "anchor": "laid not his hand"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.11#p2-3c3daa75",
     "text": "That is, rejoiced.",
     "label": "g",
     "anchor": "did eat and drink"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.12",
   "range": "EXO.24.12",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "a5723ca5",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.12#p1-b93fd708",
     "text": "The second time.",
     "label": "h",
     "anchor": "said unto Moses"
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.12#p2-447dd33c",
     "text": "Signifying the hardness of our hearts, unless God writes his laws in it by his Spirit, Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
     "label": "i",
     "anchor": "tables of stone",
     "refs": [
      {
       "text": "Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
       "ref": "JER.31.33"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
       "ref": "EZK.11.19"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
       "ref": "2CO.3.3"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
       "ref": "HEB.8.10"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jer 31:33, Eze 11:19, 2Co 3:3, He 8:10,10:16",
       "ref": "HEB.10.16"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.12#p3-6655ea1b",
     "text": "That is, the people.",
     "label": "k",
     "anchor": "them"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "geneva/EXO.24.17",
   "range": "EXO.24.17",
   "kind": "passage",
   "hash": "05dede2f",
   "paragraphs": [
    {
     "id": "geneva/EXO.24.17#p1-05dede2f",
     "text": "The Lord appears like devouring fire to carnal men: but to them that he draws with his Spirit, he is like pleasant sapphire.",
     "label": "l",
     "anchor": "devouring fire on the top of"
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
}
